--------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOSBox
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The DOSBox emulator core in `src/`, `include/`, `visualc_net/` and `scripts/`
is DOSBox r4305, imported verbatim from the Em-DOSBox project. The documents
that came with it - `docs/PORTING` and `docs/README.video` - are part of that
import and are kept unmodified; the WhereQ documents that sit beside them
are listed below.

`docs/dosbox.1` is the one document from that import that has been changed.
Its SEE ALSO section pointed at `/usr/share/doc/dosbox`, a path that this
build never creates, so the section has been removed. The file is marked as
altered in its own header, which records the change and the date of the last
upstream revision (Sep 08, 2015). The rest of the text is upstream's.

